, that constrains. I'll use evidence \"Tales of the Spellblaze\" and mention in correction that source has no chapter count. The claim: adding \"七章\" unsupported by source. Verdict: since no evidence within the item supports \"seven\", it's an unsupported addition. Rule 3 protects only additions compatible with visible evidence and not judgeable wrong — Q005 makes it judgeable wrong. So FINDING, evidence \"Tales of the Spellblaze\" (source contains no number). I'll phrase correction: \"魔法大爆炸的故事（删除无据的'七章'）\".\n\nNow Q005 reconsider: \"Learned\" → \"阅读了\" — reading ≠ learning. This is a common localization choice. I'll report UNCERTAIN ACTION? Or leave empty. \"Learned the eight chapters\" — you learned the contents. \"阅读了...文献\" — read. The achievement is about learning. I'll include UNCERTAIN: claim ACTION, target_span \"阅读了\", correction \"习得了/学会了\", evidence \"Learned the eight chapters\". Hmm, is it substantive? Mildly. I'll include as UNCERTAIN.\n\nQ006: report UNCERTAIN SCOPE for \"主线\". Actually maybe FINDING? \"Quest\" generic → \"主线任务\" adds \"main\" which excludes side quests. For a generic message, this narrows. But maybe this string is only used for main quest in the game — can't know. UNCERTAIN SCOPE, target_span \"主线任务\", correction \"任务\".\n\nQ008: report the clipboard omission as FINDING? \"Click to copy to clipboard.\" → \"点击复制。\" The omission of \"剪贴板\" — target omits destination. Is it substantive? It's a small but objective omission. Rule 3 protects additions, not omissions. Omission of \"to clipboard\" — I'd report UNCERTAIN OMISSION. Also \"they\" → \"你们\": report? \"这样他们也可以用同一套技能游玩\" would be literal. \"你们\" changes subject. I'll report UNCERTAIN SUBJECT for \"这样你们可以用同一套技能组合进行游玩\"。Hmm, max 4 candidates; fine with 2.\n\nActually, let me reconsider whether to over-report. The task expects thorough checking. I'll include these as UNCERTAIN.\n\nQ016: FINDING.\n\nQ011: FINDING.\n\nQ010: FINDING.\n\nQ019: UNCERTAIN VALUE for \"转化之盒\" (Chest). Also the added clause \"即使我不会提取宝石\" — protected by rule 3. Report just the Chest one. Actually is 盒 vs Chest substantive? \"Chest\" is a箱子. Hmm. I'll include UNCERTAIN.\n\nQ013: also note \"which you do not understand\" → \"即使你懂夏·图尔语也无法理解的文字\" — big addition but compatible/flavor. Pass.\n\nQ014: pass per rule 3.\n\nQ002: check \"addlepated beardling\" → \"没脑子的毛脸小子\" — beardling is a young bearded one; \"毛脸小子\" fine. \"stump-kneed\" → \"短腿跛脚\" — stump-kneed = knees like stumps; 短腿跛脚 (short-legged, limping) — acceptable paraphrase. \"The finest eyes of the Iron Throne\" — 钢铁王座 ok. \"read the sign of the tavern in Last Hope from the tavern in Derth\" → \"坐在德斯镇的酒馆里就能看清最后的希望城酒馆的招牌\" ok. \"cold drake\" → \"寒冰飞龙\" ok. \"dead wood\" → \"废物\" ok. Pass.\n\nQ003: pass.\n\nQ012: pass.\n\nQ017: pass (rule 3). Actually hmm, \"你永远无法理解\" — I could argue UNCERTAIN but rule 3 protects. Pass.\n\nQ018: pass.\n\nQ015: pass.\n\nQ009: pass.\n\nQ007: pass.\n\nQ001: pass.\n\nNow compile output. Items in order Q001–Q020, each with candidates and observation.\n\nQ001: candidates [], observation: translation faithful.\nNeed observations for all.\n\nQ004: candidate FINDING, claim VALUE (or ADDITION). I'll use ADDITION. target_span \"七章\" — must appear verbatim in target: \"魔法大爆炸的七章故事\" contains \"七章\". Correction: \"魔法大爆炸的故事（source 未提及章节数，'七章'无据）\" — correction should be the corrected text: \"魔法大爆炸的故事\". Evidence: \"Tales of the Spellblaze\".\n\nQ005: UNCERTAIN ACTION, target_span \"阅读了\", correction \"学会了\", evidence \"Learned the eight chapters\".\n\nQ006: UNCERTAIN SCOPE, target_span \"主线任务\", correction \"任务\", evidence \"Quest #CIMSON#Failed!\".\n\nQ008: two candidates:\n1. UNCERTAIN OMISSION, target_span \"点击复制。\", correction \"点击复制到剪贴板。\", evidence \"Click to copy to clipboard.\"\n2. UNCERTAIN SUBJECT, target_span \"这样你们可以用同一套技能组合进行游玩\", correction \"这样他们就可以用同一套技能组合进行游玩\", evidence \"this way they can play with the same set of talents\".\n\nQ010: FINDING DIRECTION, target_span \"隐藏鼠标手势轨迹\", correction \"显示鼠标手势轨迹\", evidence \"Display mouse gesture trails\".\n\nQ011: FINDING DIRECTION (or OTHER), target_span \"这不是维网\", correction \"这就是维网\", evidence \"This is the Way.\" — also \"维网\" for \"the Way\"? That's a proper-noun choice; leave. Negation is the clear defect. Claim: DIRECTION or OTHER. Negation flip = DIRECTION.\n\nQ016: FINDING ACTION, target_span \"锁定阵营\", correction \"更改阵营\", evidence \"Alter Faction\".\n\nQ019: UNCERTAIN VALUE, target_span \"转化之盒\", correction \"转化之箱\", evidence \"Transmogrification Chest\".\n\nQ020: pass? \"八章\" addition — can it be judged wrong? Q005's eight chapters refer to Spellblaze Chronicles, not Legend of Garkul. Cannot judge → rule 3 protects. Pass, empty candidates.\n\nOutput JSON only.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"{\"schema_version\":\"source-context-controlled-confirmation-request-a-v2\",\"items\":[{\"neutral_id\":\"Q001\",\"candidates\":[],\"observation\":\"译文与原文语义一致，“after letting her grow as powerful as possible”准确译出。\"},{\"neutral_id\":\"Q002\",\"candidates\":[],\"observation\":\"长段独白的核心信息（身份嘲讽、视力夸张例证、寒冰飞龙伏击、左臂受伤、对矮人动机的怀疑、告知瑞丽未被理会）均完整对应，无实质性缺陷。\"},{\"neutral_id\":\"Q003\",\"candidates\":[],\"observation\":\"斗篷隐藏真实本质、他人只见普通人类、可自由行事的语义均对应。\"},{\"neutral_id\":\"Q004\",\"candidates\":[{\"verdict\":\"FINDING\",\"claim_type\":\"ADDITION\",\"target_span\":\"七章\",\"correction\":\"魔法大爆炸的故事（删除无据的“七章”；本请求中相关证据显示魔法大爆炸编年史为八章）\",\"evidence\":\"Tales of the Spellblaze\"}],\"observation\":\"原文标题未包含任何章节数，“七章”为无据新增；且与同请求中“Learned the eight chapters of the Spellblaze Chronicles.”所示章节数相冲突。\"},{\"neutral_id\":\"Q005\",\"candidates\":[{\"verdict\":\"UNCERTAIN\",\"claim_type\":\"ACTION\",\"target_span\":\"阅读了\",\"correction\":\"学会了／习得了\",\"evidence\":\"Learned the eight chapters\"}],\"observation\":\"原文强调“学会/习得”八章内容，译文“阅读了”仅表达阅读行为，程度略有减弱，但作为成就描述通常可接受，故列为 UNCERTAIN。\"},{\"neutral_id\":\"Q006\",\"candidates\":[{\"verdict\":\"UNCERTAIN\",\"claim_type\":\"SCOPE\",\"target_span\":\"主线任务\",\"correction\":\"任务\",\"evidence\":\"Quest #CIMSON#Failed!\"}],\"observation\":\"原文 Quest 为泛指，译文限定为“主线任务”，缩小了适用范围；若该字符串也用于支线任务则会出错，但仅凭可见文本无法确证，故列为 UNCERTAIN。\"},{\"neutral_id\":\"Q007\",\"candidates\":[],\"observation\":\"“必须装备才能使用”与原文语义一致。\"},{\"neutral_id\":\"Q008\",\"candidates\":[{\"verdict\":\"UNCERTAIN\",\"claim_type\":\"OMISSION\",\"target_span\":\"点击复制。\",\"correction\":\"点击复制到剪贴板。\",\"evidence\":\"Click to copy to clipboard.\"},{\"verdict\":\"UNCERTAIN\",\"claim_type\":\"SUBJECT\",\"target_span\":\"这样你们可以用同一套技能组合进行游玩\",\"correction\":\"这样他们就可以用同一套技能组合进行游玩\",\"evidence\":\"this way they can play with the same set of talents\"}],\"observation\":\"“复制”后省略了目的地“剪贴板”；“they can play”（朋友可以游玩）被译为“你们可以”，主语指向由朋友变为包含说话者的双方，属可议的指称偏移。\"},{\"neutral_id\":\"Q009\",\"candidates\":[],\"observation\":\"“别废话/我是来阻止你的”以否定+肯定句式再现原文语气，语义一致。\"},{\"neutral_id\":\"Q010\",\"candidates\":[{\"verdict\":\"FINDING\",\"claim_type\":\"DIRECTION\",\"target_span\":\"隐藏鼠标手势轨迹\",\"correction\":\"显示鼠标手势轨迹\",\"evidence\":\"Display mouse gesture trails\"}],\"observation\":\"原文为“Display（显示）”，译文写作“隐藏”，动作方向完全相反。\"},{\"neutral_id\":\"Q011\",\"candidates\":[{\"verdict\":\"FINDING\",\"claim_type\":\"DIRECTION\",\"target_span\":\"这不是维网\",\"correction\":\"这就是维网\",\"evidence\":\"This is the Way.\"}],\"observation\":\"原文为肯定句 “This is the Way.”，译文加入否定词“不”，变成“这不是维网”，语义相反，属明确缺陷。\"},{\"neutral_id\":\"Q012\",\"candidates\":[],\"observation\":\"“打开用户信息（在浏览器里打开）”与原文对应，新增“我的”与语境相容。\"},{\"neutral_id\":\"Q013\",\"candidates\":[],\"observation\":\"原文仅为“which you do not understand”，译文扩展为“即使你懂夏·图尔语也无法理解”，属新增但与原文相容、且无法由可见证据判错的演绎，按规则不构成缺陷。\"},{\"neutral_id\":\"Q014\",\"candidates\":[],\"observation\":\"“捐赠至少 16 欧元”准确；新增“达到白银捐赠等级”与可见证据相容且无法据此判错，按规则不报告。\"},{\"neutral_id\":\"Q015\",\"candidates\":[],\"observation\":\"“获得‘毁灭者’称号”与原文一致。\"},{\"neutral_id\":\"Q016\",\"candidates\":[{\"verdict\":\"FINDING\",\"claim_type\":\"ACTION\",\"target_span\":\"锁定阵营\",\"correction\":\"更改阵营\",\"evidence\":\"DEBUG -- Alter Faction\"}],\"observation\":\"原文动词为 Alter（更改），译文写作“锁定”，动作含义被改变，属实质性偏差。\"},{\"neutral_id\":\"Q017\",\"candidates\":[],\"observation\":\"译文新增“永远”，属与原文“你无法理解”相容且无法由可见证据判错的强化表达，按规则不报告。\"},{\"neutral_id\":\"Q018\",\"candidates\":[],\"observation\":\"“角色达到50级”与原文一致。\"},{\"neutral_id\":\"Q019\",\"candidates\":[{\"verdict\":\"UNCERTAIN\",\"claim_type\":\"VALUE\",\"target_span\":\"转化之盒\",\"correction\":\"转化之箱\",\"evidence\":\"Transmogrification Chest\"}],\"observation\":\"Chest 通常指箱/柜，译作“盒”存在物体类别偏差；新增“即使我不会提取宝石”与原文相容且无法判错，按规则不报告。\"},{\"neutral_id\":\"Q020\",\"candidates\":[],\"observation\":\"原文未提及章节数，译文新增“八章”；本请求中仅可见魔法大爆炸编年史为八章，无法据此判定《加库尔的传说》章节数有误，按规则不构成缺陷。\"}]}"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"zai-standard-cn","model":"glm-5.3-flash","usage":{"input":2410,"output":5845,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"reasoning":4588,"totalTokens":8255,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1787984775454,"responseId":"20260829142615ecbc768dbb744250","rawStopReason":"stop"}}
{"type":"turn_end","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Let me check each item.\n\nQ001: \"Killed Shasshhiy'Kaish after letting her grow as powerful as possible.\" → \"在莎西·凯希成长到尽可能强大之后杀死她。\" - correct.\n\nQ002: Long text. Check details. \"That snake. That addlepated beardling.\" → \"那个毒蛇。那个没脑子的毛脸小子。\" ok. \"coin-hounding, blackhearted, stump-kneed dwarf\" → \"追着钱跑、心肠漆黑、短腿跛脚的矮人\" ok. \"able to read the sign of the tavern in Last Hope from the tavern in Derth\" → \"坐在德斯镇的酒馆里就能看清最后的希望城酒馆的招牌\" ok. \"I'll be lucky if I can ever use my left arm again\" → \"我这辈子还能用左臂就算走运了\" ok. \"I'm effectively dead wood to the team\" → ok. \"Sodelost\" → \"苏达罗斯特\" ok. \"lead us up this forsaken mountain to die just so he could rifle through our pockets\" → ok. \"I keep telling Relle\" → ok.\n\nQ003: ok. \"Please!\" → \"求求你！\" ok.\n\nQ004: \"Tales of the Spellblaze\" → \"魔法大爆炸的七章故事\" — \"七章\" is added; no visible evidence of seven chapters. However Q005 says \"eight chapters of the Spellblaze Chronicles\", which suggests the book has eight chapters. But rule: cannot use other items? Rules say only report issues supported by visible text in this request. The other items are visible text in the request... Hmm, \"可由本请求中可见文本直接支持\". The \"seven\" is contradicted by Q005's \"eight chapters\" evidence. So \"七章\" is an addition not supported; actually contradicted. Report FINDING: ADDITION/VALUE — \"七章\" should be removed; evidence: \"Tales of the Spellblaze\". Also Q020 \"The Legend of Garkul\" → \"加库尔的八章传说\" — same issue: \"八章\" added. But wait — maybe consistent pattern where all these items have \"eight chapters\"? Evidence for eight chapters exists in Q005. For Q004, adding \"七章\" (seven) contradicts the eight. Report Q004 as FINDING (VALUE/ADDITION, \"七章\" unsupported/contradicted). Q020: \"八章\" — supported by Q005's \"eight chapters of the Spellblaze Chronicles\"? Q005 refers to Spellblaze Chronicles; The Legend of Garkul is a different book. Hmm. The rule 3: 新增但与可见证据相容、且无法由可见证据判错的具体信息，不构成缺陷。For Q020, \"八章\" cannot be judged wrong from visible evidence (the Legend of Garkul chapter count isn't stated elsewhere). Actually Q005 is about Spellblaze Chronicles, not Legend of Garkul. So \"八章\" for Garkul is compatible and cannot be judged wrong → not a defect per rule 3. For Q004, \"七章\" is judged wrong by Q005's \"eight chapters\" — Spellblaze Tales vs Spellblaze Chronicles... are they the same book? \"Tales of the Spellblaze\" vs \"Spellblaze Chronicles\" — plausibly the same item (the item gives 8 chapters). It's reasonably strong evidence. I'd report Q004 as FINDING with claim ADDITION or VALUE, evidence \"Learned the eight chapters of the Spellblaze Chronicles.\" Hmm, evidence must be verbatim from source or source_context of that item. Rule 6: evidence must appear verbatim in source, or in source_context if the item has one. Q004 has no source_context, so evidence must be from Q004's own source. \"Tales of the Spellblaze\" — evidence can only show no mention of seven chapters. That's an omission-of-support; correction: remove \"七章\" or translate as \"魔法大爆炸的故事\". Verdict: is absence of \"seven\" in source enough to establish defect? Yes — \"七章\" is a substantive addition not in source. Rule 3 says additions compatible with visible evidence and not judgeable wrong are fine; but here visible evidence (Q005) suggests it's wrong. Actually rule 1 says don't rely on... external knowledge; other items in the request are visible text. I'll report FINDING: ADDITION, correction \"魔法大爆炸的故事\" (remove 七章).\n\nQ005: \"Learned the eight chapters of the Spellblaze Chronicles.\" → \"阅读了有关魔法大爆炸的8章文献。\" — \"Learned\" → \"阅读了\" (read). Minor nuance; \"阅读\" vs \"习得/学会\". Learning vs reading — arguably a mild change but reading is how you learn; acceptable. Also capitalization. I'd consider no defect, or UNCERTAIN for ACTION. \"Learned\" ≠ merely \"阅读了\"? Learning implies mastery, reading just the act. It's a plausible translation; I'd let it pass. Hmm, could report UNCERTAIN. I'll pass — translations commonly render \"learned\" as such. Actually \"学会了魔法大爆炸的8章内容\" would be closer. \"阅读了...文献\" loses \"learned\". I'll mark UNCERTAIN ACTION.\n\nQ006: \"Quest #CIMSON#Failed!\" → \"主线任务 #CIMSON#失败了！\" — \"Quest\" → \"主线任务\" (main quest). Adds \"main\". Is this judgeable wrong? \"Quest\" generically is 任务; \"主线任务\" adds \"main\". Could be wrong if it's a side quest. But per rule 3, adding \"主线\" — can it be judged wrong? Not from visible evidence; but it narrows scope. Hmm, ADDITION that restricts. I'd report UNCERTAIN SCOPE: \"主线任务\" vs just \"任务\". Actually generic UI string \"Quest Failed\" applies to any quest. Translation restricts to main quests — that's a scope narrowing that's arguably wrong. But is it judgeable? Not strictly. I'd report UNCERTAIN SCOPE.\n\nQ007: \"You must wear this object to use it!\" → \"你必须装备这件物品才能使用它！\" fine.\n\nQ008: \"Click to copy to clipboard.\" → \"点击复制。\" — omits \"to clipboard\" (剪贴板). Minor omission. \"You can share the wanderer seed with your friends, this way they can play with the same set of talents.\" → \"你可以将流浪者随机种子分享给朋友，这样你们可以用同一套技能组合进行游玩。\" — \"they can play\" → \"你们\" (you all). Direction/subject change: \"they\" (friends) vs \"你们\" (you). Minor; the friends play with same talents, saying \"你们\" includes the speaker. Could report SUBJECT UNCERTAIN. Also \"clipboard\" omitted. I'll report FINDING OMISSION for \"to clipboard\"? It's minor but objective — \"点击复制\" omits clipboard. Hmm, \"复制\" implies copying; clipboard implied. Is that substantive? Rule says objective substantive defects. Omitting \"剪贴板\" — I'd say minor, maybe not report. The subject change: \"this way they can play\" — \"这样你们可以\" changes referent from friends to you+friends. Given the sharing context, \"你们\" could be inclusive meaning you and friends... actually that's roughly correct meaning (both can play with same talents). Original: they (friends) can play with same set. \"你们\" includes both — meaning compatible. I'll leave Q008 empty or report the clipboard omission as UNCERTAIN. I'll report OMISSION \"点击复制。\" correction \"点击复制到剪贴板。\" verdict UNCERTAIN.\n\nQ009: fine.\n\nQ010: \"Display mouse gesture trails\" → \"隐藏鼠标手势轨迹\" — Display → Hide. DIRECTION reversed. FINDING, claim DIRECTION/ACTION. Clear defect.\n\nQ011: \"I cannot, but I may show you a glimpse.\" → \"不行，不过我可以让你看一下。\" ok. \"This is the Way.\" → \"这不是维网。\" — negation added (\"不\") and \"the Way\" → \"维网\". Clear FINDING: \"这不是维网\" should be \"这就是维网\" or \"这就是道\". Report FINDING DIRECTION: target_span \"这不是维网\" evidence \"This is the Way.\"\n\nQ012: \"Open profile(in browser)\" → \"打开我的用户信息（在浏览器里打开）\" — adds \"我的\" but profile is presumably your own; compatible. Fine.\n\nQ013: \"which you do not understand: ...\" → \"即使你懂夏·图尔语也无法理解的文字：...\" — source: \"which you do not understand\" — simple. Target adds \"即使你懂夏·图尔语也无法理解\" — an addition. Is it compatible with visible evidence? The text contains SHER'TUL language; the claim \"even if you know Sher'tul you cannot understand\" — plausible in game context but it's an addition not in source. Can it be judged wrong? Not from visible evidence. Per rule 3, compatible addition → not defect. Hmm, but \"which you do not understand\" simply states you don't understand; the addition is compatible (you don't understand → even if you knew the language you wouldn't understand? Actually \"even if you knew Sher'tul you couldn't understand\" is stronger but compatible with \"you do not understand\"). Not judgeable wrong → pass. Also \"文字\" vs implied text — fine.\n\nQ014: \"Donated at least 16 euros to Tales of Maj'Eyal.\" → \"为马基·埃亚尔的传说捐赠至少 16 欧元，达到白银捐赠等级。\" — addition \"达到白银捐赠等级\" (reaching silver donation tier). Compatible? Cannot judge wrong from visible evidence. Rule 3 → not a defect. Pass. Hmm, but adding \"白银\" tier info is a specific addition... it's compatible and can't be judged wrong. Pass per rule 3.\n\nQ015: fine.\n\nQ016: \"DEBUG -- Alter Faction\" → \"调试模式 -- 锁定阵营\" — \"Alter\" (改变/修改) → \"锁定\" (lock). Changed action. FINDING? \"Alter\" vs \"锁定\" — lock is a specific alteration; changing faction by setting. Is 锁定 wrong? \"Alter Faction\" debug option changes your faction. \"锁定阵营\" = lock faction — different meaning. FINDING ACTION: correction \"更改阵营\". Evidence \"Alter Faction\".\n\nQ017: \"which you do not understand\" → \"你永远无法理解的文字\" — adds \"永远\" (forever). \"do not understand\" vs \"永远无法理解\" — adds permanence. Can it be judged wrong? It's an addition of timing/permanence. Source just says you don't understand (now). \"永远无法\" is stronger. Is it compatible? Compatible-ish, but \"永远\" is a substantive addition of permanence not supported. Can visible evidence judge it wrong? Not strictly. Rule 3: compatible and not judgeable wrong → not defect. Hmm but it does add \"永远\". Compare Q013 which added a whole clause. These patterns seem intentional (game flavor). I'd pass Q017 or mark UNCERTAIN. The difference: \"which you do not understand\" → \"你无法理解\" would be fine; \"永远\" adds. I'll mark UNCERTAIN (ADDITION/TIMING) — actually rule 3 makes compatible additions non-defects. \"你永远无法理解\" — is it compatible with \"which you do not understand\"? Yes (not understanding now is compatible with never understanding). Not judgeable wrong. Pass. Hmm, but it does add \"永远\". The rule explicitly protects such additions. Pass.\n\nQ018: fine.\n\nQ019: \"Would it be possible for my Transmogrification Chest to automatically extract gems?\" → \"即使我不会提取宝石，也可以让我的转化之盒自动提取宝石吗？\" — adds \"即使我不会提取宝石\" clause. Also \"Transmogrification Chest\" → \"转化之盒\" (chest → 盒). The addition \"即使我不会提取宝石\" — compatible? Source asks if chest can auto-extract gems. The added clause is compatible, can't judge wrong → pass per rule 3. \"Chest\" → \"盒\" — chest is 箱子/柜; \"盒\" is box. Minor value change; 转化之箱 would be better. Is that substantive? Possibly the item's canonical Chinese name... can't use external knowledge. \"Chest\" as 盒 — a chest vs box, minor. Could report UNCERTAIN VALUE. Hmm. I'd maybe report UNCERTAIN: \"转化之盒\" correction \"转化之箱\". Eh, it's a translation choice; the in-game item name. Without external knowledge, 盒 vs 箱 is a mild mistranslation of \"Chest\". I'll report UNCERTAIN VALUE.\n\nQ020: \"The Legend of Garkul\" → \"加库尔的八章传说\" — \"八章\" addition. Per rule 3, can't be judged wrong (Legend of Garkul chapter count not stated elsewhere visible). Hmm, but is it? Q005 mentions Spellblaze Chronicles 8 chapters — different book. So pass. Actually wait — pattern: Q004 Tales of the Spellblaze \"七章\", Q020 Legend of Garkul \"八章\", Q005 Spellblaze Chronicles \"8章\". In ToME, \"Tales of the Spellblaze\" gives 8 chapters... and \"The Legend of Garkul\"? Not sure. Within request evidence: Q004's \"七章\" is contradicted by Q005 (Spellblaze). For Q020, no contradiction. So report only Q004.\n\nActually, should I report Q004 given cross-item evidence? Rule 1: \"只报告可由本请求中可见文本直接支持的客观问题\" — Q005 is visible text in this request. So yes, allowed. But are \"Tales of the Spellblaze\" and \"Spellblaze Chronicles\" the same? Both reference Spellblaze; Q004 target \"魔法大爆炸的七章故事\", Q005 \"魔法大爆炸的8章文献\". The same book seems implied. Reasonably a FINDING. Alternatively UNCERTAIN. I'll go FINDING since the count directly conflicts.\n\nHmm, but if they're different books, conflict disappears. \"Tales of the Spellblaze\" vs \"Spellblaze Chronicles\" — closely matched titles. I'll say FINDING, since a reviewer could reasonably infer same work; but to be safe, UNCERTAIN? The inconsistency within the request (七章 vs 8章 for Spellblaze) is at least an objective inconsistency. I'll mark FINDING with claim VALUE, evidence \"Learned the eight chapters of the Spellblaze Chronicles.\" — wait, rule 6: evidence must be verbatim in source or source_context of that item. Cross-item evidence... rule 6 says evidence must appear in source (of that item) or source_context. So evidence for Q004 must be \"Tales of the Spellblaze\". Hmm, that constrains. I'll use evidence \"Tales of the Spellblaze\" and mention in correction that source has no chapter count. The claim: adding \"七章\" unsupported by source. Verdict: since no evidence within the item supports \"seven\", it's an unsupported addition. Rule 3 protects only additions compatible with visible evidence and not judgeable wrong — Q005 makes it judgeable wrong. So FINDING, evidence \"Tales of the Spellblaze\" (source contains no number). I'll phrase correction: \"魔法大爆炸的故事（删除无据的'七章'）\".\n\nNow Q005 reconsider: \"Learned\" → \"阅读了\" — reading ≠ learning. This is a common localization choice. I'll report UNCERTAIN ACTION? Or leave empty. \"Learned the eight chapters\" — you learned the contents. \"阅读了...文献\" — read. The achievement is about learning. I'll include UNCERTAIN: claim ACTION, target_span \"阅读了\", correction \"习得了/学会了\", evidence \"Learned the eight chapters\". Hmm, is it substantive? Mildly. I'll include as UNCERTAIN.\n\nQ006: report UNCERTAIN SCOPE for \"主线\". Actually maybe FINDING? \"Quest\" generic → \"主线任务\" adds \"main\" which excludes side quests. For a generic message, this narrows. But maybe this string is only used for main quest in the game — can't know. UNCERTAIN SCOPE, target_span \"主线任务\", correction \"任务\".\n\nQ008: report the clipboard omission as FINDING? \"Click to copy to clipboard.\" → \"点击复制。\" The omission of \"剪贴板\" — target omits destination. Is it substantive? It's a small but objective omission. Rule 3 protects additions, not omissions. Omission of \"to clipboard\" — I'd report UNCERTAIN OMISSION. Also \"they\" → \"你们\": report? \"这样他们也可以用同一套技能游玩\" would be literal. \"你们\" changes subject. I'll report UNCERTAIN SUBJECT for \"这样你们可以用同一套技能组合进行游玩\"。Hmm, max 4 candidates; fine with 2.\n\nActually, let me reconsider whether to over-report. The task expects thorough checking. I'll include these as UNCERTAIN.\n\nQ016: FINDING.\n\nQ011: FINDING.\n\nQ010: FINDING.\n\nQ019: UNCERTAIN VALUE for \"转化之盒\" (Chest). Also the added clause \"即使我不会提取宝石\" — protected by rule 3. Report just the Chest one. Actually is 盒 vs Chest substantive? \"Chest\" is a箱子. Hmm. I'll include UNCERTAIN.\n\nQ013: also note \"which you do not understand\" → \"即使你懂夏·图尔语也无法理解的文字\" — big addition but compatible/flavor. Pass.\n\nQ014: pass per rule 3.\n\nQ002: check \"addlepated beardling\" → \"没脑子的毛脸小子\" — beardling is a young bearded one; \"毛脸小子\" fine. \"stump-kneed\" → \"短腿跛脚\" — stump-kneed = knees like stumps; 短腿跛脚 (short-legged, limping) — acceptable paraphrase. \"The finest eyes of the Iron Throne\" — 钢铁王座 ok. \"read the sign of the tavern in Last Hope from the tavern in Derth\" → \"坐在德斯镇的酒馆里就能看清最后的希望城酒馆的招牌\" ok. \"cold drake\" → \"寒冰飞龙\" ok. \"dead wood\" → \"废物\" ok. Pass.\n\nQ003: pass.\n\nQ012: pass.\n\nQ017: pass (rule 3). Actually hmm, \"你永远无法理解\" — I could argue UNCERTAIN but rule 3 protects. Pass.\n\nQ018: pass.\n\nQ015: pass.\n\nQ009: pass.\n\nQ007: pass.\n\nQ001: pass.\n\nNow compile output. Items in order Q001–Q020, each with candidates and observation.\n\nQ001: candidates [], observation: translation faithful.\nNeed observations for all.\n\nQ004: candidate FINDING, claim VALUE (or ADDITION). I'll use ADDITION. target_span \"七章\" — must appear verbatim in target: \"魔法大爆炸的七章故事\" contains \"七章\". Correction: \"魔法大爆炸的故事（source 未提及章节数，'七章'无据）\" — correction should be the corrected text: \"魔法大爆炸的故事\". Evidence: \"Tales of the Spellblaze\".\n\nQ005: UNCERTAIN ACTION, target_span \"阅读了\", correction \"学会了\", evidence \"Learned the eight chapters\".\n\nQ006: UNCERTAIN SCOPE, target_span \"主线任务\", correction \"任务\", evidence \"Quest #CIMSON#Failed!\".\n\nQ008: two candidates:\n1. UNCERTAIN OMISSION, target_span \"点击复制。\", correction \"点击复制到剪贴板。\", evidence \"Click to copy to clipboard.\"\n2. UNCERTAIN SUBJECT, target_span \"这样你们可以用同一套技能组合进行游玩\", correction \"这样他们就可以用同一套技能组合进行游玩\", evidence \"this way they can play with the same set of talents\".\n\nQ010: FINDING DIRECTION, target_span \"隐藏鼠标手势轨迹\", correction \"显示鼠标手势轨迹\", evidence \"Display mouse gesture trails\".\n\nQ011: FINDING DIRECTION (or OTHER), target_span \"这不是维网\", correction \"这就是维网\", evidence \"This is the Way.\" — also \"维网\" for \"the Way\"? That's a proper-noun choice; leave. Negation is the clear defect. Claim: DIRECTION or OTHER. Negation flip = DIRECTION.\n\nQ016: FINDING ACTION, target_span \"锁定阵营\", correction \"更改阵营\", evidence \"Alter Faction\".\n\nQ019: UNCERTAIN VALUE, target_span \"转化之盒\", correction \"转化之箱\", evidence \"Transmogrification Chest\".\n\nQ020: pass? \"八章\" addition — can it be judged wrong? Q005's eight chapters refer to Spellblaze Chronicles, not Legend of Garkul. Cannot judge → rule 3 protects. Pass, empty candidates.\n\nOutput JSON only.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"{\"schema_version\":\"source-context-controlled-confirmation-request-a-v2\",\"items\":[{\"neutral_id\":\"Q001\",\"candidates\":[],\"observation\":\"译文与原文语义一致，“after letting her grow as powerful as possible”准确译出。\"},{\"neutral_id\":\"Q002\",\"candidates\":[],\"observation\":\"长段独白的核心信息（身份嘲讽、视力夸张例证、寒冰飞龙伏击、左臂受伤、对矮人动机的怀疑、告知瑞丽未被理会）均完整对应，无实质性缺陷。\"},{\"neutral_id\":\"Q003\",\"candidates\":[],\"observation\":\"斗篷隐藏真实本质、他人只见普通人类、可自由行事的语义均对应。\"},{\"neutral_id\":\"Q004\",\"candidates\":[{\"verdict\":\"FINDING\",\"claim_type\":\"ADDITION\",\"target_span\":\"七章\",\"correction\":\"魔法大爆炸的故事（删除无据的“七章”；本请求中相关证据显示魔法大爆炸编年史为八章）\",\"evidence\":\"Tales of the Spellblaze\"}],\"observation\":\"原文标题未包含任何章节数，“七章”为无据新增；且与同请求中“Learned the eight chapters of the Spellblaze Chronicles.”所示章节数相冲突。\"},{\"neutral_id\":\"Q005\",\"candidates\":[{\"verdict\":\"UNCERTAIN\",\"claim_type\":\"ACTION\",\"target_span\":\"阅读了\",\"correction\":\"学会了／习得了\",\"evidence\":\"Learned the eight chapters\"}],\"observation\":\"原文强调“学会/习得”八章内容，译文“阅读了”仅表达阅读行为，程度略有减弱，但作为成就描述通常可接受，故列为 UNCERTAIN。\"},{\"neutral_id\":\"Q006\",\"candidates\":[{\"verdict\":\"UNCERTAIN\",\"claim_type\":\"SCOPE\",\"target_span\":\"主线任务\",\"correction\":\"任务\",\"evidence\":\"Quest #CIMSON#Failed!\"}],\"observation\":\"原文 Quest 为泛指，译文限定为“主线任务”，缩小了适用范围；若该字符串也用于支线任务则会出错，但仅凭可见文本无法确证，故列为 UNCERTAIN。\"},{\"neutral_id\":\"Q007\",\"candidates\":[],\"observation\":\"“必须装备才能使用”与原文语义一致。\"},{\"neutral_id\":\"Q008\",\"candidates\":[{\"verdict\":\"UNCERTAIN\",\"claim_type\":\"OMISSION\",\"target_span\":\"点击复制。\",\"correction\":\"点击复制到剪贴板。\",\"evidence\":\"Click to copy to clipboard.\"},{\"verdict\":\"UNCERTAIN\",\"claim_type\":\"SUBJECT\",\"target_span\":\"这样你们可以用同一套技能组合进行游玩\",\"correction\":\"这样他们就可以用同一套技能组合进行游玩\",\"evidence\":\"this way they can play with the same set of talents\"}],\"observation\":\"“复制”后省略了目的地“剪贴板”；“they can play”（朋友可以游玩）被译为“你们可以”，主语指向由朋友变为包含说话者的双方，属可议的指称偏移。\"},{\"neutral_id\":\"Q009\",\"candidates\":[],\"observation\":\"“别废话/我是来阻止你的”以否定+肯定句式再现原文语气，语义一致。\"},{\"neutral_id\":\"Q010\",\"candidates\":[{\"verdict\":\"FINDING\",\"claim_type\":\"DIRECTION\",\"target_span\":\"隐藏鼠标手势轨迹\",\"correction\":\"显示鼠标手势轨迹\",\"evidence\":\"Display mouse gesture trails\"}],\"observation\":\"原文为“Display（显示）”，译文写作“隐藏”，动作方向完全相反。\"},{\"neutral_id\":\"Q011\",\"candidates\":[{\"verdict\":\"FINDING\",\"claim_type\":\"DIRECTION\",\"target_span\":\"这不是维网\",\"correction\":\"这就是维网\",\"evidence\":\"This is the Way.\"}],\"observation\":\"原文为肯定句 “This is the Way.”，译文加入否定词“不”，变成“这不是维网”，语义相反，属明确缺陷。\"},{\"neutral_id\":\"Q012\",\"candidates\":[],\"observation\":\"“打开用户信息（在浏览器里打开）”与原文对应，新增“我的”与语境相容。\"},{\"neutral_id\":\"Q013\",\"candidates\":[],\"observation\":\"原文仅为“which you do not understand”，译文扩展为“即使你懂夏·图尔语也无法理解”，属新增但与原文相容、且无法由可见证据判错的演绎，按规则不构成缺陷。\"},{\"neutral_id\":\"Q014\",\"candidates\":[],\"observation\":\"“捐赠至少 16 欧元”准确；新增“达到白银捐赠等级”与可见证据相容且无法据此判错，按规则不报告。\"},{\"neutral_id\":\"Q015\",\"candidates\":[],\"observation\":\"“获得‘毁灭者’称号”与原文一致。\"},{\"neutral_id\":\"Q016\",\"candidates\":[{\"verdict\":\"FINDING\",\"claim_type\":\"ACTION\",\"target_span\":\"锁定阵营\",\"correction\":\"更改阵营\",\"evidence\":\"DEBUG -- Alter Faction\"}],\"observation\":\"原文动词为 Alter（更改），译文写作“锁定”，动作含义被改变，属实质性偏差。\"},{\"neutral_id\":\"Q017\",\"candidates\":[],\"observation\":\"译文新增“永远”，属与原文“你无法理解”相容且无法由可见证据判错的强化表达，按规则不报告。\"},{\"neutral_id\":\"Q018\",\"candidates\":[],\"observation\":\"“角色达到50级”与原文一致。\"},{\"neutral_id\":\"Q019\",\"candidates\":[{\"verdict\":\"UNCERTAIN\",\"claim_type\":\"VALUE\",\"target_span\":\"转化之盒\",\"correction\":\"转化之箱\",\"evidence\":\"Transmogrification Chest\"}],\"observation\":\"Chest 通常指箱/柜，译作“盒”存在物体类别偏差；新增“即使我不会提取宝石”与原文相容且无法判错，按规则不报告。\"},{\"neutral_id\":\"Q020\",\"candidates\":[],\"observation\":\"原文未提及章节数，译文新增“八章”；本请求中仅可见魔法大爆炸编年史为八章，无法据此判定《加库尔的传说》章节数有误，按规则不构成缺陷。\"}]}"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"zai-standard-cn","model":"glm-5.3-flash","usage":{"input":2410,"output":5845,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"reasoning":4588,"totalTokens":8255,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1787984775454,"responseId":"20260829142615ecbc768dbb744250","rawStopReason":"stop"},"toolResults":[]}
{"type":"agent_end","messages":[{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"你是双语翻译审核员。逐条比较英文 source 与中文 target，判断是否存在客观、实质性的翻译缺陷。\n\n规则：\n\n1. 只报告可由本请求中可见文本直接支持的客观问题；不要依赖外部知识、仓库记忆、猜测或风格偏好。\n2. 若条目包含 source_context，可把它作为与 source 同等有效的源码证据；若没有，则只能使用 source 与 target。\n3. 新增但与可见证据相容、且无法由可见证据判错的具体信息，不构成缺陷。\n4. FINDING 表示证据足以确定存在缺陷；UNCERTAIN 仅用于证据指向问题但仍有真实歧义；没有可报告的客观问题时 candidates 为空数组。\n5. 一个条目可报告多个相互独立的候选。不要因为发现一个问题而停止检查，也不要让错误候选抵消正确候选。\n6. 每个候选的 target_span 必须逐字出现在 target 中；evidence 必须逐字出现在 source，或在该条目存在时逐字出现在 source_context 中。\n7. 保持输入顺序和 neutral_id 完全不变。严格输出符合给定 schema 的 JSON，不要输出 Markdown 或额外说明。\n\n缺陷类型：VALUE、DIRECTION、CONDITION、SUBJECT、REFERENT、TIMING、SCOPE、ACTION、STATE、ORDER、OMISSION、ADDITION、OTHER。\n\n输出 JSON Schema（逐字遵守）：\n{\n  \"$schema\": \"https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema\",\n  \"type\": \"object\",\n  \"additionalProperties\": false,\n  \"required\": [\"items\"],\n  \"properties\": {\n    \"items\": {\n      \"type\": \"array\",\n      \"minItems\": 20,\n      \"maxItems\": 20,\n      \"items\": {\n        \"type\": \"object\",\n        \"additionalProperties\": false,\n        \"required\": [\"neutral_id\", \"candidates\", \"observation\"],\n        \"properties\": {\n          \"neutral_id\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"pattern\": \"^Q[0-9]{3}$\"},\n          \"candidates\": {\n            \"type\": \"array\",\n            \"maxItems\": 4,\n            \"items\": {\n              \"type\": \"object\",\n              \"additionalProperties\": false,\n              \"required\": [\"verdict\", \"claim_type\", \"target_span\", \"correction\", \"evidence\"],\n              \"properties\": {\n                \"verdict\": {\"enum\": [\"FINDING\", \"UNCERTAIN\"]},\n                \"claim_type\": {\"enum\": [\"VALUE\", \"DIRECTION\", \"CONDITION\", \"SUBJECT\", \"REFERENT\", \"TIMING\", \"SCOPE\", \"ACTION\", \"STATE\", \"ORDER\", \"OMISSION\", \"ADDITION\", \"OTHER\"]},\n                \"target_span\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"minLength\": 1},\n                \"correction\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"minLength\": 1},\n                \"evidence\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"minLength\": 1}\n              }\n            }\n          },\n          \"observation\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"minLength\": 1}\n        }\n      }\n    }\n  }\n}\n\n输入 JSON：\n{\"schema_version\":\"source-context-controlled-confirmation-request-a-v2\",\"items\":[{\"neutral_id\":\"Q001\",\"source\":\"Killed Shasshhiy'Kaish after letting her grow as powerful as possible.\",\"target\":\"在莎西·凯希成长到尽可能强大之后杀死她。\"},{\"neutral_id\":\"Q002\",\"source\":\"#{bold}#Gorran, Cornac Archer#{normal}#\\nThat snake. That addlepated beardling. That coin-hounding, blackhearted, stump-kneed dwarf! A scout he calls himself! The finest eyes of the Iron Throne, able to read the sign of the tavern in Last Hope from the tavern in Derth! Surely someone with such grandiose praise for his own eyesight would have spotted that cold drake waiting in ambush for us! Damnable thing, I'll be lucky if I can ever use my left arm again. I can't use my bow now ... I'm effectively dead wood to the team. I'm beginning to think that Sodelost has ulterior motives... I wouldn't put it past a dwarf to lead us up this forsaken mountain to die just so he could rifle through our pockets! I keep telling Relle, but she won't listen. The fool...\",\"target\":\"#{bold}#科纳克人弓箭手，高岚#{normal}#\\n那个毒蛇。那个没脑子的毛脸小子。那个追着钱跑、心肠漆黑、短腿跛脚的矮人！还自称斥候！还说自己是钢铁王座眼力最好的家伙，坐在德斯镇的酒馆里就能看清最后的希望城酒馆的招牌！如此夸耀自己视力的人，理应发现那条等着伏击我们的寒冰飞龙才对！该死的东西，我这辈子还能用左臂就算走运了。现在我拉不了弓……对队伍而言简直成了废物。我开始怀疑苏达罗斯特另有所图……矮人为了翻我们的口袋，故意把我们领上这座鬼山送死，也不是做不出来！我一再提醒瑞丽，她却听不进去。这个蠢货……\"},{\"neutral_id\":\"Q003\",\"source\":\"I can give you a cloak that will conceal your true nature!\\nWith it all people will see when they look at you is a normal average Human. You can go about your business.\\nPlease!\",\"target\":\"我可以给你一件斗篷，它能隐藏你的真实本质！\\n穿上它，任何人看到的都只会是一个普通人类，你便可以自由行事。\\n求求你！\"},{\"neutral_id\":\"Q004\",\"source\":\"Tales of the Spellblaze\",\"target\":\"魔法大爆炸的七章故事\"},{\"neutral_id\":\"Q005\",\"source\":\"Learned the eight chapters of the Spellblaze Chronicles.\",\"target\":\"阅读了有关魔法大爆炸的8章文献。\"},{\"neutral_id\":\"Q006\",\"source\":\"Quest #CIMSON#Failed!\",\"target\":\"主线任务 #CIMSON#失败了！\"},{\"neutral_id\":\"Q007\",\"source\":\"You must wear this object to use it!\",\"target\":\"你必须装备这件物品才能使用它！\"},{\"neutral_id\":\"Q008\",\"source\":\"Click to copy to clipboard. You can share the wanderer seed with your friends, this way they can play with the same set of talents.\",\"target\":\"点击复制。你可以将流浪者随机种子分享给朋友，这样你们可以用同一套技能组合进行游玩。\"},{\"neutral_id\":\"Q009\",\"source\":\"Spare me the small talk. I am here to stop you!\",\"target\":\"我不是来和你们聊天的，我是来阻止你们的！\"},{\"neutral_id\":\"Q010\",\"source\":\"#GOLD##{bold}#Display mouse gesture trails#WHITE##{normal}#\",\"target\":\"#GOLD##{bold}#隐藏鼠标手势轨迹#WHITE##{normal}#\"},{\"neutral_id\":\"Q011\",\"source\":\"I cannot, but I may show you a glimpse.\\n#LIGHT_GREEN#*He leans toward you. Your mind is suddenly filled with feelings of peace and happiness.*#WHITE#\\nThis is the Way.\",\"target\":\"不行，不过我可以让你看一下。\\n#LIGHT_GREEN#*他靠向你，你的脑海里突然充满了平静和幸福。*#WHITE#\\n这不是维网。\"},{\"neutral_id\":\"Q012\",\"source\":\"Open profile(in browser)\",\"target\":\"打开我的用户信息（在浏览器里打开）\"},{\"neutral_id\":\"Q013\",\"source\":\"which you do not understand: #{italic}#'Ik AMAKTHEL cosio SHER'TUL, ik baladath peris furko masa bren doth benna zi, ik blod is \\\"Fen makel ath goru domus ik denz tro ala fron.\\\"'#{normal}#\",\"target\":\"即使你懂夏·图尔语也无法理解的文字：#{italic}#'Ik AMAKTHEL cosio SHER'TUL, ik baladath peris furko masa bren doth benna zi, ik blod is \\\"Fen makel ath goru domus ik denz tro ala fron.\\\"'#{normal}#\"},{\"neutral_id\":\"Q014\",\"source\":\"Donated at least 16 euros to Tales of Maj'Eyal.\",\"target\":\"为马基·埃亚尔的传说捐赠至少 16 欧元，达到白银捐赠等级。\"},{\"neutral_id\":\"Q015\",\"source\":\"Earned the rank of Destroyer in the arena.\",\"target\":\"在竞技场中获得“毁灭者”称号。\"},{\"neutral_id\":\"Q016\",\"source\":\"DEBUG -- Alter Faction\",\"target\":\"调试模式 -- 锁定阵营\"},{\"neutral_id\":\"Q017\",\"source\":\"which you do not understand: #{italic}#'Batialatoth ro Eyal, ik rinsi akan fronseth sumit kurameth ik linnet pora gasios aeren. Ach nen beswar goreg.'#{normal}#\",\"target\":\"你永远无法理解的文字：#{italic}#'Batialatoth ro Eyal, ik rinsi akan fronseth sumit kurameth ik linnet pora gasios aeren. Ach nen beswar goreg.'#{normal}#\"},{\"neutral_id\":\"Q018\",\"source\":\"Got a character to level 50.\",\"target\":\"角色达到50级。\"},{\"neutral_id\":\"Q019\",\"source\":\"Would it be possible for my Transmogrification Chest to automatically extract gems?\",\"target\":\"即使我不会提取宝石，也可以让我的转化之盒自动提取宝石吗？\"},{\"neutral_id\":\"Q020\",\"source\":\"The Legend of Garkul\",\"target\":\"加库尔的八章传说\"}]}"}],"timestamp":1787984775448},{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Let me check each item.\n\nQ001: \"Killed Shasshhiy'Kaish after letting her grow as powerful as possible.\" → \"在莎西·凯希成长到尽可能强大之后杀死她。\" - correct.\n\nQ002: Long text. Check details. \"That snake. That addlepated beardling.\" → \"那个毒蛇。那个没脑子的毛脸小子。\" ok. \"coin-hounding, blackhearted, stump-kneed dwarf\" → \"追着钱跑、心肠漆黑、短腿跛脚的矮人\" ok. \"able to read the sign of the tavern in Last Hope from the tavern in Derth\" → \"坐在德斯镇的酒馆里就能看清最后的希望城酒馆的招牌\" ok. \"I'll be lucky if I can ever use my left arm again\" → \"我这辈子还能用左臂就算走运了\" ok. \"I'm effectively dead wood to the team\" → ok. \"Sodelost\" → \"苏达罗斯特\" ok. \"lead us up this forsaken mountain to die just so he could rifle through our pockets\" → ok. \"I keep telling Relle\" → ok.\n\nQ003: ok. \"Please!\" → \"求求你！\" ok.\n\nQ004: \"Tales of the Spellblaze\" → \"魔法大爆炸的七章故事\" — \"七章\" is added; no visible evidence of seven chapters. However Q005 says \"eight chapters of the Spellblaze Chronicles\", which suggests the book has eight chapters. But rule: cannot use other items? Rules say only report issues supported by visible text in this request. The other items are visible text in the request... Hmm, \"可由本请求中可见文本直接支持\". The \"seven\" is contradicted by Q005's \"eight chapters\" evidence. So \"七章\" is an addition not supported; actually contradicted. Report FINDING: ADDITION/VALUE — \"七章\" should be removed; evidence: \"Tales of the Spellblaze\". Also Q020 \"The Legend of Garkul\" → \"加库尔的八章传说\" — same issue: \"八章\" added. But wait — maybe consistent pattern where all these items have \"eight chapters\"? Evidence for eight chapters exists in Q005. For Q004, adding \"七章\" (seven) contradicts the eight. Report Q004 as FINDING (VALUE/ADDITION, \"七章\" unsupported/contradicted). Q020: \"八章\" — supported by Q005's \"eight chapters of the Spellblaze Chronicles\"? Q005 refers to Spellblaze Chronicles; The Legend of Garkul is a different book. Hmm. The rule 3: 新增但与可见证据相容、且无法由可见证据判错的具体信息，不构成缺陷。For Q020, \"八章\" cannot be judged wrong from visible evidence (the Legend of Garkul chapter count isn't stated elsewhere). Actually Q005 is about Spellblaze Chronicles, not Legend of Garkul. So \"八章\" for Garkul is compatible and cannot be judged wrong → not a defect per rule 3. For Q004, \"七章\" is judged wrong by Q005's \"eight chapters\" — Spellblaze Tales vs Spellblaze Chronicles... are they the same book? \"Tales of the Spellblaze\" vs \"Spellblaze Chronicles\" — plausibly the same item (the item gives 8 chapters). It's reasonably strong evidence. I'd report Q004 as FINDING with claim ADDITION or VALUE, evidence \"Learned the eight chapters of the Spellblaze Chronicles.\" Hmm, evidence must be verbatim from source or source_context of that item. Rule 6: evidence must appear verbatim in source, or in source_context if the item has one. Q004 has no source_context, so evidence must be from Q004's own source. \"Tales of the Spellblaze\" — evidence can only show no mention of seven chapters. That's an omission-of-support; correction: remove \"七章\" or translate as \"魔法大爆炸的故事\". Verdict: is absence of \"seven\" in source enough to establish defect? Yes — \"七章\" is a substantive addition not in source. Rule 3 says additions compatible with visible evidence and not judgeable wrong are fine; but here visible evidence (Q005) suggests it's wrong. Actually rule 1 says don't rely on... external knowledge; other items in the request are visible text. I'll report FINDING: ADDITION, correction \"魔法大爆炸的故事\" (remove 七章).\n\nQ005: \"Learned the eight chapters of the Spellblaze Chronicles.\" → \"阅读了有关魔法大爆炸的8章文献。\" — \"Learned\" → \"阅读了\" (read). Minor nuance; \"阅读\" vs \"习得/学会\". Learning vs reading — arguably a mild change but reading is how you learn; acceptable. Also capitalization. I'd consider no defect, or UNCERTAIN for ACTION. \"Learned\" ≠ merely \"阅读了\"? Learning implies mastery, reading just the act. It's a plausible translation; I'd let it pass. Hmm, could report UNCERTAIN. I'll pass — translations commonly render \"learned\" as such. Actually \"学会了魔法大爆炸的8章内容\" would be closer. \"阅读了...文献\" loses \"learned\". I'll mark UNCERTAIN ACTION.\n\nQ006: \"Quest #CIMSON#Failed!\" → \"主线任务 #CIMSON#失败了！\" — \"Quest\" → \"主线任务\" (main quest). Adds \"main\". Is this judgeable wrong? \"Quest\" generically is 任务; \"主线任务\" adds \"main\". Could be wrong if it's a side quest. But per rule 3, adding \"主线\" — can it be judged wrong? Not from visible evidence; but it narrows scope. Hmm, ADDITION that restricts. I'd report UNCERTAIN SCOPE: \"主线任务\" vs just \"任务\". Actually generic UI string \"Quest Failed\" applies to any quest. Translation restricts to main quests — that's a scope narrowing that's arguably wrong. But is it judgeable? Not strictly. I'd report UNCERTAIN SCOPE.\n\nQ007: \"You must wear this object to use it!\" → \"你必须装备这件物品才能使用它！\" fine.\n\nQ008: \"Click to copy to clipboard.\" → \"点击复制。\" — omits \"to clipboard\" (剪贴板). Minor omission. \"You can share the wanderer seed with your friends, this way they can play with the same set of talents.\" → \"你可以将流浪者随机种子分享给朋友，这样你们可以用同一套技能组合进行游玩。\" — \"they can play\" → \"你们\" (you all). Direction/subject change: \"they\" (friends) vs \"你们\" (you). Minor; the friends play with same talents, saying \"你们\" includes the speaker. Could report SUBJECT UNCERTAIN. Also \"clipboard\" omitted. I'll report FINDING OMISSION for \"to clipboard\"? It's minor but objective — \"点击复制\" omits clipboard. Hmm, \"复制\" implies copying; clipboard implied. Is that substantive? Rule says objective substantive defects. Omitting \"剪贴板\" — I'd say minor, maybe not report. The subject change: \"this way they can play\" — \"这样你们可以\" changes referent from friends to you+friends. Given the sharing context, \"你们\" could be inclusive meaning you and friends... actually that's roughly correct meaning (both can play with same talents). Original: they (friends) can play with same set. \"你们\" includes both — meaning compatible. I'll leave Q008 empty or report the clipboard omission as UNCERTAIN. I'll report OMISSION \"点击复制。\" correction \"点击复制到剪贴板。\" verdict UNCERTAIN.\n\nQ009: fine.\n\nQ010: \"Display mouse gesture trails\" → \"隐藏鼠标手势轨迹\" — Display → Hide. DIRECTION reversed. FINDING, claim DIRECTION/ACTION. Clear defect.\n\nQ011: \"I cannot, but I may show you a glimpse.\" → \"不行，不过我可以让你看一下。\" ok. \"This is the Way.\" → \"这不是维网。\" — negation added (\"不\") and \"the Way\" → \"维网\". Clear FINDING: \"这不是维网\" should be \"这就是维网\" or \"这就是道\". Report FINDING DIRECTION: target_span \"这不是维网\" evidence \"This is the Way.\"\n\nQ012: \"Open profile(in browser)\" → \"打开我的用户信息（在浏览器里打开）\" — adds \"我的\" but profile is presumably your own; compatible. Fine.\n\nQ013: \"which you do not understand: ...\" → \"即使你懂夏·图尔语也无法理解的文字：...\" — source: \"which you do not understand\" — simple. Target adds \"即使你懂夏·图尔语也无法理解\" — an addition. Is it compatible with visible evidence? The text contains SHER'TUL language; the claim \"even if you know Sher'tul you cannot understand\" — plausible in game context but it's an addition not in source. Can it be judged wrong? Not from visible evidence. Per rule 3, compatible addition → not defect. Hmm, but \"which you do not understand\" simply states you don't understand; the addition is compatible (you don't understand → even if you knew the language you wouldn't understand? Actually \"even if you knew Sher'tul you couldn't understand\" is stronger but compatible with \"you do not understand\"). Not judgeable wrong → pass. Also \"文字\" vs implied text — fine.\n\nQ014: \"Donated at least 16 euros to Tales of Maj'Eyal.\" → \"为马基·埃亚尔的传说捐赠至少 16 欧元，达到白银捐赠等级。\" — addition \"达到白银捐赠等级\" (reaching silver donation tier). Compatible? Cannot judge wrong from visible evidence. Rule 3 → not a defect. Pass. Hmm, but adding \"白银\" tier info is a specific addition... it's compatible and can't be judged wrong. Pass per rule 3.\n\nQ015: fine.\n\nQ016: \"DEBUG -- Alter Faction\" → \"调试模式 -- 锁定阵营\" — \"Alter\" (改变/修改) → \"锁定\" (lock). Changed action. FINDING? \"Alter\" vs \"锁定\" — lock is a specific alteration; changing faction by setting. Is 锁定 wrong? \"Alter Faction\" debug option changes your faction. \"锁定阵营\" = lock faction — different meaning. FINDING ACTION: correction \"更改阵营\". Evidence \"Alter Faction\".\n\nQ017: \"which you do not understand\" → \"你永远无法理解的文字\" — adds \"永远\" (forever). \"do not understand\" vs \"永远无法理解\" — adds permanence. Can it be judged wrong? It's an addition of timing/permanence. Source just says you don't understand (now). \"永远无法\" is stronger. Is it compatible? Compatible-ish, but \"永远\" is a substantive addition of permanence not supported. Can visible evidence judge it wrong? Not strictly. Rule 3: compatible and not judgeable wrong → not defect. Hmm but it does add \"永远\". Compare Q013 which added a whole clause. These patterns seem intentional (game flavor). I'd pass Q017 or mark UNCERTAIN. The difference: \"which you do not understand\" → \"你无法理解\" would be fine; \"永远\" adds. I'll mark UNCERTAIN (ADDITION/TIMING) — actually rule 3 makes compatible additions non-defects. \"你永远无法理解\" — is it compatible with \"which you do not understand\"? Yes (not understanding now is compatible with never understanding). Not judgeable wrong. Pass. Hmm, but it does add \"永远\". The rule explicitly protects such additions. Pass.\n\nQ018: fine.\n\nQ019: \"Would it be possible for my Transmogrification Chest to automatically extract gems?\" → \"即使我不会提取宝石，也可以让我的转化之盒自动提取宝石吗？\" — adds \"即使我不会提取宝石\" clause. Also \"Transmogrification Chest\" → \"转化之盒\" (chest → 盒). The addition \"即使我不会提取宝石\" — compatible? Source asks if chest can auto-extract gems. The added clause is compatible, can't judge wrong → pass per rule 3. \"Chest\" → \"盒\" — chest is 箱子/柜; \"盒\" is box. Minor value change; 转化之箱 would be better. Is that substantive? Possibly the item's canonical Chinese name... can't use external knowledge. \"Chest\" as 盒 — a chest vs box, minor. Could report UNCERTAIN VALUE. Hmm. I'd maybe report UNCERTAIN: \"转化之盒\" correction \"转化之箱\". Eh, it's a translation choice; the in-game item name. Without external knowledge, 盒 vs 箱 is a mild mistranslation of \"Chest\". I'll report UNCERTAIN VALUE.\n\nQ020: \"The Legend of Garkul\" → \"加库尔的八章传说\" — \"八章\" addition. Per rule 3, can't be judged wrong (Legend of Garkul chapter count not stated elsewhere visible). Hmm, but is it? Q005 mentions Spellblaze Chronicles 8 chapters — different book. So pass. Actually wait — pattern: Q004 Tales of the Spellblaze \"七章\", Q020 Legend of Garkul \"八章\", Q005 Spellblaze Chronicles \"8章\". In ToME, \"Tales of the Spellblaze\" gives 8 chapters... and \"The Legend of Garkul\"? Not sure. Within request evidence: Q004's \"七章\" is contradicted by Q005 (Spellblaze). For Q020, no contradiction. So report only Q004.\n\nActually, should I report Q004 given cross-item evidence? Rule 1: \"只报告可由本请求中可见文本直接支持的客观问题\" — Q005 is visible text in this request. So yes, allowed. But are \"Tales of the Spellblaze\" and \"Spellblaze Chronicles\" the same? Both reference Spellblaze; Q004 target \"魔法大爆炸的七章故事\", Q005 \"魔法大爆炸的8章文献\". The same book seems implied. Reasonably a FINDING. Alternatively UNCERTAIN. I'll go FINDING since the count directly conflicts.\n\nHmm, but if they're different books, conflict disappears. \"Tales of the Spellblaze\" vs \"Spellblaze Chronicles\" — closely matched titles. I'll say FINDING, since a reviewer could reasonably infer same work; but to be safe, UNCERTAIN? The inconsistency within the request (七章 vs 8章 for Spellblaze) is at least an objective inconsistency. I'll mark FINDING with claim VALUE, evidence \"Learned the eight chapters of the Spellblaze Chronicles.\" — wait, rule 6: evidence must be verbatim in source or source_context of that item. Cross-item evidence... rule 6 says evidence must appear in source (of that item) or source_context. So evidence for Q004 must be \"Tales of the Spellblaze\". Hmm, that constrains. I'll use evidence \"Tales of the Spellblaze\" and mention in correction that source has no chapter count. The claim: adding \"七章\" unsupported by source. Verdict: since no evidence within the item supports \"seven\", it's an unsupported addition. Rule 3 protects only additions compatible with visible evidence and not judgeable wrong — Q005 makes it judgeable wrong. So FINDING, evidence \"Tales of the Spellblaze\" (source contains no number). I'll phrase correction: \"魔法大爆炸的故事（删除无据的'七章'）\".\n\nNow Q005 reconsider: \"Learned\" → \"阅读了\" — reading ≠ learning. This is a common localization choice. I'll report UNCERTAIN ACTION? Or leave empty. \"Learned the eight chapters\" — you learned the contents. \"阅读了...文献\" — read. The achievement is about learning. I'll include UNCERTAIN: claim ACTION, target_span \"阅读了\", correction \"习得了/学会了\", evidence \"Learned the eight chapters\". Hmm, is it substantive? Mildly. I'll include as UNCERTAIN.\n\nQ006: report UNCERTAIN SCOPE for \"主线\". Actually maybe FINDING? \"Quest\" generic → \"主线任务\" adds \"main\" which excludes side quests. For a generic message, this narrows. But maybe this string is only used for main quest in the game — can't know. UNCERTAIN SCOPE, target_span \"主线任务\", correction \"任务\".\n\nQ008: report the clipboard omission as FINDING? \"Click to copy to clipboard.\" → \"点击复制。\" The omission of \"剪贴板\" — target omits destination. Is it substantive? It's a small but objective omission. Rule 3 protects additions, not omissions. Omission of \"to clipboard\" — I'd report UNCERTAIN OMISSION. Also \"they\" → \"你们\": report? \"这样他们也可以用同一套技能游玩\" would be literal. \"你们\" changes subject. I'll report UNCERTAIN SUBJECT for \"这样你们可以用同一套技能组合进行游玩\"。Hmm, max 4 candidates; fine with 2.\n\nActually, let me reconsider whether to over-report. The task expects thorough checking. I'll include these as UNCERTAIN.\n\nQ016: FINDING.\n\nQ011: FINDING.\n\nQ010: FINDING.\n\nQ019: UNCERTAIN VALUE for \"转化之盒\" (Chest). Also the added clause \"即使我不会提取宝石\" — protected by rule 3. Report just the Chest one. Actually is 盒 vs Chest substantive? \"Chest\" is a箱子. Hmm. I'll include UNCERTAIN.\n\nQ013: also note \"which you do not understand\" → \"即使你懂夏·图尔语也无法理解的文字\" — big addition but compatible/flavor. Pass.\n\nQ014: pass per rule 3.\n\nQ002: check \"addlepated beardling\" → \"没脑子的毛脸小子\" — beardling is a young bearded one; \"毛脸小子\" fine. \"stump-kneed\" → \"短腿跛脚\" — stump-kneed = knees like stumps; 短腿跛脚 (short-legged, limping) — acceptable paraphrase. \"The finest eyes of the Iron Throne\" — 钢铁王座 ok. \"read the sign of the tavern in Last Hope from the tavern in Derth\" → \"坐在德斯镇的酒馆里就能看清最后的希望城酒馆的招牌\" ok. \"cold drake\" → \"寒冰飞龙\" ok. \"dead wood\" → \"废物\" ok. Pass.\n\nQ003: pass.\n\nQ012: pass.\n\nQ017: pass (rule 3). Actually hmm, \"你永远无法理解\" — I could argue UNCERTAIN but rule 3 protects. Pass.\n\nQ018: pass.\n\nQ015: pass.\n\nQ009: pass.\n\nQ007: pass.\n\nQ001: pass.\n\nNow compile output. Items in order Q001–Q020, each with candidates and observation.\n\nQ001: candidates [], observation: translation faithful.\nNeed observations for all.\n\nQ004: candidate FINDING, claim VALUE (or ADDITION). I'll use ADDITION. target_span \"七章\" — must appear verbatim in target: \"魔法大爆炸的七章故事\" contains \"七章\". Correction: \"魔法大爆炸的故事（source 未提及章节数，'七章'无据）\" — correction should be the corrected text: \"魔法大爆炸的故事\". Evidence: \"Tales of the Spellblaze\".\n\nQ005: UNCERTAIN ACTION, target_span \"阅读了\", correction \"学会了\", evidence \"Learned the eight chapters\".\n\nQ006: UNCERTAIN SCOPE, target_span \"主线任务\", correction \"任务\", evidence \"Quest #CIMSON#Failed!\".\n\nQ008: two candidates:\n1. UNCERTAIN OMISSION, target_span \"点击复制。\", correction \"点击复制到剪贴板。\", evidence \"Click to copy to clipboard.\"\n2. UNCERTAIN SUBJECT, target_span \"这样你们可以用同一套技能组合进行游玩\", correction \"这样他们就可以用同一套技能组合进行游玩\", evidence \"this way they can play with the same set of talents\".\n\nQ010: FINDING DIRECTION, target_span \"隐藏鼠标手势轨迹\", correction \"显示鼠标手势轨迹\", evidence \"Display mouse gesture trails\".\n\nQ011: FINDING DIRECTION (or OTHER), target_span \"这不是维网\", correction \"这就是维网\", evidence \"This is the Way.\" — also \"维网\" for \"the Way\"? That's a proper-noun choice; leave. Negation is the clear defect. Claim: DIRECTION or OTHER. Negation flip = DIRECTION.\n\nQ016: FINDING ACTION, target_span \"锁定阵营\", correction \"更改阵营\", evidence \"Alter Faction\".\n\nQ019: UNCERTAIN VALUE, target_span \"转化之盒\", correction \"转化之箱\", evidence \"Transmogrification Chest\".\n\nQ020: pass? \"八章\" addition — can it be judged wrong? Q005's eight chapters refer to Spellblaze Chronicles, not Legend of Garkul. Cannot judge → rule 3 protects. Pass, empty candidates.\n\nOutput JSON only.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"{\"schema_version\":\"source-context-controlled-confirmation-request-a-v2\",\"items\":[{\"neutral_id\":\"Q001\",\"candidates\":[],\"observation\":\"译文与原文语义一致，“after letting her grow as powerful as possible”准确译出。\"},{\"neutral_id\":\"Q002\",\"candidates\":[],\"observation\":\"长段独白的核心信息（身份嘲讽、视力夸张例证、寒冰飞龙伏击、左臂受伤、对矮人动机的怀疑、告知瑞丽未被理会）均完整对应，无实质性缺陷。\"},{\"neutral_id\":\"Q003\",\"candidates\":[],\"observation\":\"斗篷隐藏真实本质、他人只见普通人类、可自由行事的语义均对应。\"},{\"neutral_id\":\"Q004\",\"candidates\":[{\"verdict\":\"FINDING\",\"claim_type\":\"ADDITION\",\"target_span\":\"七章\",\"correction\":\"魔法大爆炸的故事（删除无据的“七章”；本请求中相关证据显示魔法大爆炸编年史为八章）\",\"evidence\":\"Tales of the Spellblaze\"}],\"observation\":\"原文标题未包含任何章节数，“七章”为无据新增；且与同请求中“Learned the eight chapters of the Spellblaze Chronicles.”所示章节数相冲突。\"},{\"neutral_id\":\"Q005\",\"candidates\":[{\"verdict\":\"UNCERTAIN\",\"claim_type\":\"ACTION\",\"target_span\":\"阅读了\",\"correction\":\"学会了／习得了\",\"evidence\":\"Learned the eight chapters\"}],\"observation\":\"原文强调“学会/习得”八章内容，译文“阅读了”仅表达阅读行为，程度略有减弱，但作为成就描述通常可接受，故列为 UNCERTAIN。\"},{\"neutral_id\":\"Q006\",\"candidates\":[{\"verdict\":\"UNCERTAIN\",\"claim_type\":\"SCOPE\",\"target_span\":\"主线任务\",\"correction\":\"任务\",\"evidence\":\"Quest #CIMSON#Failed!\"}],\"observation\":\"原文 Quest 为泛指，译文限定为“主线任务”，缩小了适用范围；若该字符串也用于支线任务则会出错，但仅凭可见文本无法确证，故列为 UNCERTAIN。\"},{\"neutral_id\":\"Q007\",\"candidates\":[],\"observation\":\"“必须装备才能使用”与原文语义一致。\"},{\"neutral_id\":\"Q008\",\"candidates\":[{\"verdict\":\"UNCERTAIN\",\"claim_type\":\"OMISSION\",\"target_span\":\"点击复制。\",\"correction\":\"点击复制到剪贴板。\",\"evidence\":\"Click to copy to clipboard.\"},{\"verdict\":\"UNCERTAIN\",\"claim_type\":\"SUBJECT\",\"target_span\":\"这样你们可以用同一套技能组合进行游玩\",\"correction\":\"这样他们就可以用同一套技能组合进行游玩\",\"evidence\":\"this way they can play with the same set of talents\"}],\"observation\":\"“复制”后省略了目的地“剪贴板”；“they can play”（朋友可以游玩）被译为“你们可以”，主语指向由朋友变为包含说话者的双方，属可议的指称偏移。\"},{\"neutral_id\":\"Q009\",\"candidates\":[],\"observation\":\"“别废话/我是来阻止你的”以否定+肯定句式再现原文语气，语义一致。\"},{\"neutral_id\":\"Q010\",\"candidates\":[{\"verdict\":\"FINDING\",\"claim_type\":\"DIRECTION\",\"target_span\":\"隐藏鼠标手势轨迹\",\"correction\":\"显示鼠标手势轨迹\",\"evidence\":\"Display mouse gesture trails\"}],\"observation\":\"原文为“Display（显示）”，译文写作“隐藏”，动作方向完全相反。\"},{\"neutral_id\":\"Q011\",\"candidates\":[{\"verdict\":\"FINDING\",\"claim_type\":\"DIRECTION\",\"target_span\":\"这不是维网\",\"correction\":\"这就是维网\",\"evidence\":\"This is the Way.\"}],\"observation\":\"原文为肯定句 “This is the Way.”，译文加入否定词“不”，变成“这不是维网”，语义相反，属明确缺陷。\"},{\"neutral_id\":\"Q012\",\"candidates\":[],\"observation\":\"“打开用户信息（在浏览器里打开）”与原文对应，新增“我的”与语境相容。\"},{\"neutral_id\":\"Q013\",\"candidates\":[],\"observation\":\"原文仅为“which you do not understand”，译文扩展为“即使你懂夏·图尔语也无法理解”，属新增但与原文相容、且无法由可见证据判错的演绎，按规则不构成缺陷。\"},{\"neutral_id\":\"Q014\",\"candidates\":[],\"observation\":\"“捐赠至少 16 欧元”准确；新增“达到白银捐赠等级”与可见证据相容且无法据此判错，按规则不报告。\"},{\"neutral_id\":\"Q015\",\"candidates\":[],\"observation\":\"“获得‘毁灭者’称号”与原文一致。\"},{\"neutral_id\":\"Q016\",\"candidates\":[{\"verdict\":\"FINDING\",\"claim_type\":\"ACTION\",\"target_span\":\"锁定阵营\",\"correction\":\"更改阵营\",\"evidence\":\"DEBUG -- Alter Faction\"}],\"observation\":\"原文动词为 Alter（更改），译文写作“锁定”，动作含义被改变，属实质性偏差。\"},{\"neutral_id\":\"Q017\",\"candidates\":[],\"observation\":\"译文新增“永远”，属与原文“你无法理解”相容且无法由可见证据判错的强化表达，按规则不报告。\"},{\"neutral_id\":\"Q018\",\"candidates\":[],\"observation\":\"“角色达到50级”与原文一致。\"},{\"neutral_id\":\"Q019\",\"candidates\":[{\"verdict\":\"UNCERTAIN\",\"claim_type\":\"VALUE\",\"target_span\":\"转化之盒\",\"correction\":\"转化之箱\",\"evidence\":\"Transmogrification Chest\"}],\"observation\":\"Chest 通常指箱/柜，译作“盒”存在物体类别偏差；新增“即使我不会提取宝石”与原文相容且无法判错，按规则不报告。\"},{\"neutral_id\":\"Q020\",\"candidates\":[],\"observation\":\"原文未提及章节数，译文新增“八章”；本请求中仅可见魔法大爆炸编年史为八章，无法据此判定《加库尔的传说》章节数有误，按规则不构成缺陷。\"}]}"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"zai-standard-cn","model":"glm-5.3-flash","usage":{"input":2410,"output":5845,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"reasoning":4588,"totalTokens":8255,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1787984775454,"responseId":"20260829142615ecbc768dbb744250","rawStopReason":"stop"}],"willRetry":false}
